    "detailed_description": "With the city overrun with supernatural beings and occurrences, it is up to a miko to restore the city to its former state. In order to accomplish such a task, purification rituals must be performed by the miko at the shrines scattered throughout the city. And when considering the aforementioned, getting to each of these shrines will become a task on its own\u2026<br><br>Throughout the pseudo 8-bit beat-em-up called Miko Funk, players will fight various enemies with varying attack patterns in a manner highly influenced by modern melee combat games from a quasi top-down/isometric perspective. Beyond battling, players will also encounter stealth and puzzle sections before performing the purification rituals at the shrines.<br><br>Features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Various enemies with their own attack patterns to overcome<br></li><li>Stealth and puzzle sections<br></li><li>Visual novel-style storytelling<br></li><li>Pseudo 8-bit pixel-art visuals<br></li><li>Lofi, funky hip-hop soundtrack<br></li><li>Supports Xbox Series, Xbox One, and Xbox 360 Controllers (recommended)</li></ul>",
